# Figure manifest: which generated figure feeds which name used in main.tex.
#
# Format:  <stable-name>  <TAB or spaces>  <source glob>
#
# The stable name on the left is what main.tex cites with \includegraphics.
# The glob on the right may be date-stamped; refresh-figures.sh picks the
# NEWEST match and copies it to the stable name. That indirection is the
# whole point: analysis runs and re-exported drawings can keep changing their
# filenames, while the manuscript keeps citing one unchanging name.
#
# Globs are resolved against the source roots listed in refresh-figures.sh.
# A provenance sidecar beside the matched source (same name, .yaml extension)
# is copied along with it, to the stable name with a .yaml extension.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment 1 — beam degradation along the path
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Setup drawing (Photoshop source alongside the export).
eod-setup-beam-degradation.png    EOD_exp_1.png

# Measured results, from the moving-EOD1 stage sweep (MAR_3 dataset). One graph
# per file; main.tex groups them as subfigures. The combined beam_quality_plot.png
# and beam_quality_xcorr.png these replace are still on the NAS, unused.
# The width and ellipticity graphs from this sweep (beam_quality_fwhm_x/y,
# beam_quality_ellipticity) are deliberately NOT used: the user flagged that
# data as wrong on 2026-10-26. Only the cross-correlation set is cited.
eod-beam-xcorr-ncc.png            beam_quality_xcorr_ncc.png
eod-beam-xcorr-fwhm.png           beam_quality_xcorr_fwhm.png
eod-beam-xcorr-dx.png             beam_quality_xcorr_dx.png
eod-beam-xcorr-dy.png             beam_quality_xcorr_dy.png

# Along-the-path stations (gausian/may 26 dataset): camera at fixed stations,
# one frame each. Replaces the combined beam_quality_3panel.png on the NAS.
eod-path-fwhm.png                 beam_quality_positions_fwhm.png
eod-path-ellipticity.png          beam_quality_positions_ellipticity.png
eod-path-r2.png                   beam_quality_positions_r2.png

